<title>NETHERLANDS: ING BARINGS TO OPEN KAZAKHSTAN OUTLET.</title>
<headline>ING BARINGS TO OPEN KAZAKHSTAN OUTLET.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings said on Friday it had obtained permission to open a representative office in Kazakhstan.</p>
<p>&quot;ING Barings Almaty will focus on corporate and investment banking as well as capital market activities,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>It added that opening the new office was in line with its strategy to strengthen its position in central and eastern Europe and central Asia.</p>
<p>ING Barings, part of the Dutch ING Group, has more than 130 offices in 50 countries.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
